      "the summary asks three questions, then names three submodels",
      "a new measure is motivated, defined, and only then read",
      "seven attempt shares are compressed because fewer numbers are easier to compare",
      "traits are cut because the sampler slows, and the penalty is chosen to leave four",
      "each submodel gets its own difficulty regression, because the effect need not match",
      "a Poisson is rejected for variation it cannot hold, then the wider distribution is named",
      "cause is flagged as intentional and earned by random word choice",
      "intervals that contain zero are reported as no effect, and the one exception is set apart",
      "the past is checked before the future word is forecast",
      "the letter leads with the finding and signs with the sampler"
